  "id": "superficial",
  "term": "superficial",
  "definition": "In this counselling context, superficial means limited to surface-level changes that do not address deeper cultural meanings, values, or social realities. A superficial adaptation may make an intervention look more culturally appropriate without truly grounding it in the community’s own perspectives and structures.",
